# Smart Family Frame — Cloud Functions environment (non-secret params). Copy to `.env` (or
# `.env.<project-id>` for a specific deployed project) — see WHATSAPP_SETUP.md.
#
# The three WhatsApp SECRETS (access token, app secret, webhook verify token) are NOT set here — they
# use `firebase functions:secrets:set NAME`, which stores them encrypted in Secret Manager, never in a
# file. For local emulator testing only, placeholder values live in `.secret.local` (gitignored, already
# present in this repo with dummy values — the emulator will not make real Meta API calls anyway).

WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
